---
import ProjectsSection from './ProjectsSection.astro';
---

<section class="card">
  <div class="card-body">
    <div class="flag-stripes">
      <img src="/usaflag.png" alt="US flag" class="flag-img" loading="lazy" />
      <img src="/mongolianflag.png" alt="Mongolian flag" class="flag-img" loading="lazy" />
      <div class="stripes" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="stripe--blue"></div>
        <div class="stripe--yellow"></div>
        <div class="stripe--red"></div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="section">
      <h2>What I'm Up To</h2>
      <p>Hey, I'm Temulen! I'm a rising sophomore at Lehigh University majoring in Computer Science & Business, with plans to minor in Data Science. After co-founding a <a href="https://www.cribcub.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">startup</a> for college RAs with close friends on campus, taking on a leadership role in a forward-thinking Product Management <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/lehigh-product-society/people/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">society</a>, joining a professor-backed software project, and reflecting on my path after college, I'm currently exploring a career in cybersecurity — particularly cybercrime and law enforcement.</p>
    </div>

    <ProjectsSection />

    <div class="section">
      <h2>Blog</h2>
      <p>Notes on building CribCub, ventures, and findings worth sharing. <a href="/blog/">Read →</a></p>
    </div>

    <div class="section">
      <h2>Resume</h2>
      <div class="resume-row">
        <a href="/Temulen_Resume.pdf" download>
          <img src="/resumepreview.png" alt="Resume preview" class="resume-thumb" loading="lazy" />
        </a>
        <div class="resume-meta">
          <span class="resume-status">Status: Up to date!</span>
          <span class="resume-date">Last updated: May 2026</span>
          <a href="/Temulen_Resume.pdf" download class="resume-download">Click to download</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="section">
      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <div class="contact-list">
        <a href="mailto:temulen.iveelt@gmail.com">temulen.iveelt@gmail.com</a>
        <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/temulen-iveelt/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LinkedIn</a>
        <a href="https://github.com/temulendev" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub (@temulendev)</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <img src="/goatYellow.png" alt="" class="goat" aria-hidden="true" loading="lazy" />
</section>
